{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05105","headline":"奉和圣制幸礼部尚书窦希玠宅 · 沈佺期","name":"奉和圣制幸礼部尚书窦希玠宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北阙垂旒暇，南宫听履廻。\n天临翔凤转，恩向跃龙开。\n兰气薰仙帐，榴花引御杯。\n水从金穴吐，云是玉衣来。\n池影摇歌席，林香散舞台。\n不知行漏晚，清跸尚裴徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}